# Button group

Use Button Group to combine related actions or fields. It accepts buttons, links, native controls, `AesirInput`, and text addons marked with `data-slot="button-group-text"`.

<DocsExample title="Button Group" source={buttonGroupExampleSource} htmlSource={buttonGroupExampleHtmlSource}>
	<ButtonGroupExample />
</DocsExample>

## Orientation and size

Use `orientation="vertical"` for stacked actions. The `size` prop accepts `sm`, `default`, or `lg` and normalizes the height of mixed controls inside the group.
